      <VERS vnumber="2"> I have <gr str="157">loved </gr>you, <gr str="559">saith </gr>the <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>. Yet ye <gr str="559">say</gr>, <gr str="4100">Wherein </gr>hast thou <gr str="157">loved </gr>us? <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> Was </STYLE>
