        <gr str="123">Edom </gr>
        <gr str="559">saith</gr>, We are <gr str="7567">impoverished</gr>, but we will <gr str="7725">return </gr>and <gr str="1129">build </gr>the desolate <gr str="2723">places</gr>; <gr str="3541">thus </gr>
