      <VERS vnumber="5"> And your <gr str="5869">eyes </gr>shall <gr str="7200">see</gr>, and <gr str="859">ye </gr>shall <gr str="559">say</gr>, The <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>will be <gr str="1431">magnified </gr>
